# Keep LF everywhere regardless of the checkout OS or a contributor's
# core.autocrlf: the shebang in bin/decs breaks if it ever gains a \r, and
# mixed line endings make every cross-platform diff noisy. decs's own
# parser accepts CRLF in a *user's* decisions/*.md (see core/parse.ts);
# this file is only about what this repo itself commits.
* text=auto eol=lf
